WEBVTT

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.230
<b>Wounded prey.</b>

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.000
Shuuyu!

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Where are you?

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.990
<b>A beast approaches.</b>

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.540
Shuuyu!

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:16.160
<b>A violent man.</b>

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.010
Sh-Shuuyu!

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:37.600
Stop it!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.510
Don't!

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:24.740
Seems you're awake now.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.350
You passed out from running 
out of spiritual energy.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:29.750
You need to think a little 
more about how you use it.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.380
Next time, you'll die.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:34.480
What happened to Shuuyu?

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:36.140
She's fine, for now.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.760
She was hit with an unusual attack.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.650
That's all I can say for now,

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:44.510
until I show it to my grandfather 
in the Southern Palace.

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:46.200
Grandfather?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.440
Wait, where's your Shuusou?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.900
I turned him back into a card.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:54.100
I need to build all the spiritual 
power I can get right now.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.030
We could be attacked at any moment.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:00.030
Are we being followed?

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:04.660
Do you think Hakuanshi would 
let us go so easily otherwise?

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.040
That's right.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.410
He knows we're heading for 
the Southern Palace...

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.050
What is he after?

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.430
Why is the Southern Palace 
so important to him?

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:17.830
There's something in the palace he 
needs to revive the Kan Dynasty.

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:21.420
That's what he and his people are after.

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:24.050
Then we can't go straight there.

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.080
<i>But if we don't hurry, then Shuuyu...</i>

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:30.950
Wait, where are we?

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:34.180
Outside the suburbs south of the school.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.180
Then...

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.780
Where are you going?

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:38.940
Just come with me.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.970
<i>He can move already?</i>

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:44.700
<i>That means his spiritual power is still...</i>

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.040
Why are you wasting so much time?

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.800
Haven't you found the Southern Palace yet?

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.490
Don't worry.

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.550
I have someone following them now.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.800
It should only be a matter 
of time before we find it.

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:07.270
The revival of the dynasty 
is dependent on this.

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:10.260
Find it as soon as you can.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.190
Before Suikyou interferes again.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:20.160
Your majesty, if you get excited you'll 
just waste your spiritual energy.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.570
It's not good for your heart.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:26.860
What happened to the one who found my heart?

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:29.120
I thought he was just small-fry,

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.700
but he has powerful spiritual energy.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:32.600
We can bring him over to—

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.430
No need.

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:36.830
We have all the pawns we need.

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.960
Capture him and bring him to me right away.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:43.590
I need more spiritual 
energy... more sacrifices!

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:45.260
As you wish.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:46.470
Kayuu.

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.460
Bring his majesty our offering.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.330
I've been waiting.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.980
Now bring him here.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.420
Wh-Who are you?

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.440
Where am I?

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.040
This way!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:20.420
This is a bad neighborhood, 
if I remember right.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.880
It's got a lot of narrow alleyways,

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.840
so it's perfect for losing pursuers.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:28.780
But I can't guarantee your safety.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:31.050
Why not worry about yourself?

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.610
Now let's go.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.150
There's no time to think about it.

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.690
R-Right...

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:47.390
Did you see that?

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:54.570
This way!

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:00.630
Is someone leading us somewhere?

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:01.760
Yeah.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:03.910
But we don't have a choice but to keep going.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.360
Stop.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.810
If you want to cross that line,

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:11.260
you'll have to pay the toll.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.480
This bridge is only for Yellow Scarves.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:16.700
Is he the one after us?

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:18.010
He's probably someone different.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.360
The toll is... hmm...

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:28.240
Everything both of you 
have on you, I suppose?

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:32.040
We don't have time to play stupid games.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.560
Wow, you're certainly rude.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.200
We're in a hurry.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.730
Please, let us through.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.920
You'd do better to just pay.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:41.180
It hurts, getting punched.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:45.070
Even a rich kid at Three Kingdoms 
High knows that, right?

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.820
Did you just say Three Kingdoms High?

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.630
Oops, you crossed the line!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:50.970
Wait!

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.800
You've got memories of the 
Three Kingdoms period, right?

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.240
What did you say?

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:58.640
Who do you think you are?

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.810
My name is Barini!

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.810
He's a lord!

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.530
So you're like me, huh?

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.400
That changes things.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.410
Instead of paying the toll,

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.150
you can give me all your cards!

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:21.480
He's fighting a general bare-handed?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.360
He's an earth-type lord.

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.800
Earth-type?

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:30.340
He doesn't need a general 
to protect him, like you do!

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:36.240
I'm not weak, like you guys.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.640
I fight with nothing but my fists.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:41.520
Shuusou, feel free to use your weapons.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.070
I don't want to hurt him, but...

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.480
Don't try to show off!

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:57.900
Sonshin!

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:00.580
Move, and he's dead!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.980
That's the boss for you!

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:02.660
Kill him!

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:06.280
I've had a rough day!

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:07.680
I won't let you...

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.460
Don't try and show off.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:10.960
Stop it!

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:12.670
Don't touch my cards.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:14.940
What a crappy card...

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:17.680
This wound...

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.720
I've finally found it!

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.100
Where's the general who did this?

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.850
Answer me honestly or I'll snap your neck!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.600
He's chasing out!

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:30.940
You're telling the truth, right?

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.560
We are.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:35.240
He should be very close.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:36.810
You heard her.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.620
Find him and lead him here.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.180
I'll find him!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.660
No way, I'll find him first!

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.520
Let us go!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.540
Please!

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.920
I want to save Shuuyu!

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:55.430
Go.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.540
I'm done with you.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.040
Let's go.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:08:59.800
Yeah.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:04.940
Was it okay to tell him?

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.230
We still don't know who's after us...

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.190
Let's just let him help us out.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:11.510
We need to cure Shuuyu first.

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:20.640
Houga...

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:24.300
Are you looking at the moon 
somewhere right now, too?

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.540
You know,

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:33.140
the moon's most beautiful just 
a little before it's full.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.050
Once it's full,

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.710
all it can do is wane, right?

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:40.330
Don't you think so, Barini?

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.000
Are you the boss?

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.060
Are you...

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.820
I took care of the small-fry.

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:54.320
Perfect.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:57.050
There's something I want to ask you.

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:58.570
What a coincidence.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:00.450
I have a question, too.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.200
Did you see a pair of high school students?

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:07.790
I couldn't say...

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.250
What? It's a different general.

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.730
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:16.880
I can defeat you two first and then 
take my time finding out what's up.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.240
Kaan, make it quick.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:30.440
I'll smash your bones!

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.320
Rock-head!

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.250
That looked like it hurt.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.130
What?

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:04.640
No way!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.140
Okay, we're out of the slums!

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.480
We're almost there.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.400
Hang in there.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:15.560
Yeah.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.690
<i>Shuuyu, don't die on me!</i>

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.910
<b>Ebisu</b>

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.900
One with a righteous heart

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:05.190
stands at the brink of death.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.760
For their lord, and for no one else.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.500
For a love like no other.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:12.520
An arrow rips the darkness,

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:14.370
and the dew falls,

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:16.490
unable to see tomorrow.

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:19.160
Next time: "Servant."
